NoSQL database service providing fast and predictable performance with seamless scalability.

```javascript
const dynamodb = new AWS.DynamoDB.DocumentClient();

// Put item
await dynamodb.put({
  TableName: 'Users',
  Item: {
    userId: '123',
    name: 'John',
    email: 'john@example.com'
  }
}).promise();

// Get item
const result = await dynamodb.get({
  TableName: 'Users',
  Key: { userId: '123' }
}).promise();
```

Secondary key used with partition key for composite primary key (also called range key).

```javascript
{
  PartitionKey: 'userId',
  SortKey: 'timestamp'
}
// Allows queries like: all items for userId sorted by timestamp
```

Global Secondary Index - alternative partition and sort keys for queries.

```javascript
{
  IndexName: 'EmailIndex',
  KeySchema: [
    { AttributeName: 'email', KeyType: 'HASH' }
  ],
  Projection: { ProjectionType: 'ALL' }
}
```

Local Secondary Index - same partition key, different sort key.

```javascript
{
  IndexName: 'UserTimestampIndex',
  KeySchema: [
    { AttributeName: 'userId', KeyType: 'HASH' },
    { AttributeName: 'createdAt', KeyType: 'RANGE' }
  ]
}
```

Ordered stream of item-level modifications (create, update, delete).

```javascript
// Enable streams
{
  StreamSpecification: {
    StreamEnabled: true,
    StreamViewType: 'NEW_AND_OLD_IMAGES'
  }
}

// Process with Lambda
exports.handler = async (event) => {
  for (const record of event.Records) {
    console.log(record.dynamodb.NewImage);
  }
};
```

Relational Database Service - managed SQL databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL, Oracle, SQL Server, MariaDB).

```javascript
const mysql = require('mysql');

const connection = mysql.createConnection({
  host: 'mydb.abc123.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com',
  user: 'admin',
  password: 'password',
  database: 'mydb'
});

connection.query('SELECT * FROM users', (error, results) => {
  console.log(results);
});
```

