Simple Notification Service - pub/sub messaging service.

```javascript
const sns = new AWS.SNS();

// Publish message
await sns.publish({
  TopicArn: 'arn:aws:sns:region:account:my-topic',
  Message: 'Hello from SNS',
  Subject: 'Notification'
}).promise();
```

Simple Queue Service - fully managed message queuing service.

```javascript
const sqs = new AWS.SQS();

// Send message
await sqs.sendMessage({
  QueueUrl: 'https://sqs.region.amazonaws.com/account/my-queue',
  MessageBody: JSON.stringify({ data: 'value' })
}).promise();

// Receive message
const messages = await sqs.receiveMessage({
  QueueUrl: queueUrl,
  MaxNumberOfMessages: 10,
  WaitTimeSeconds: 20  // long polling
}).promise();
```

