Cross-Origin Resource Sharing - allow web apps to access S3 from different domains.

```javascript
{
  "CORSRules": [{
    "AllowedOrigins": ["https://example.com"],
    "AllowedMethods": ["GET", "PUT", "POST"],
    "AllowedHeaders": ["*"],
    "MaxAgeSeconds": 3000
  }]
}
```

Temporary URL granting time-limited access to private S3 objects.

```javascript
