Simple Email Service - send and receive emails.

```javascript
const ses = new AWS.SES();

await ses.sendEmail({
  Source: 'sender@example.com',
  Destination: {
    ToAddresses: ['recipient@example.com']
  },
  Message: {
    Subject: { Data: 'Test Email' },
    Body: { Text: { Data: 'Email content' } }
  }
}).promise();
```

